Z||000000||Cooter||09-08-2000||08:18 PM||||After getting the same spam- "Loose weight now...." several times, I did a little spamming of my own.<BR>I traced down the "real" email address for the folks sending the mail and I used this program called "TOAD" and mass mailed them back with the message "Take me off your list!" I set the program to send the email 250 times. Well, AOL didn't like it, and it took a couple of phone calls and explaining the situation before I could get back on.<P>So- if you "mail bomb" somebody, keep it under 100 mails so you dont get a TOS violation! The AOL lady laughed and said that was the best one she had heard today. But I think next time, I will just delete the spam instead.||||reg||1
