Z||000010||Fleabitdog||09-18-2000||08:14 AM||||If you are talking about the pop ups when you sign on, I know they are a pain in the butt!!  All you have to do is go to the top of your screen (toolbar) click on my aol then next screen click on preferences, next screen click on marketing preferences,next screen click on pop up, next screen click on continue, finally next screen click on " No I do not want to receive special aol members only- pop up offers then click ok. Hope that helps you.  dave ||||reg||1
